  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1971-p13.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The binomial expansion gives \\[ \\begin{gathered} (1+0.0025)^{10}\\\\ =1+10(0.0025)\\\\ \\quad+45(0.0025)^2\\\\ \\quad+120(0.0025)^3+\\cdots\\\\ =1.025283125\\ldots \\end{gathered} \\] which rounds to \\(1.02528.\\) The fifth decimal digit is \\(8.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "Write \\(1.0025=1+0.0025\\)",
        "In the binomial expansion, retain terms large enough to affect the fifth decimal place"
      ],
